<para id="fs-id2318927"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6.582</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>-এর আসন্নমান নির্ণয় করো—নিকটতম <span class="token">ⓐ</span> শতাংশে <span class="token">ⓑ</span> দশাংশে <span class="token">ⓒ</span> পূর্ণসংখ্যায়।</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2606069">
<para id="fs-id1774692"><list id="eip-id1168469657484" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 6.58 </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 6.6 </item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> 7</item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
